

.css practice




add link to css file in html structure under title tag

----------------------html structure----------------------
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style6.css">
</head>




write css code in style6.css file and link it to html structure
-----------------------css structure----------------------
.heading {
    background-color: rgb(221, 221, 214);
    text-align: center;
}

